<title>INDONESIA: Modern Photo sees 97 net at 73 bln rph.</title>
<headline>Modern Photo sees 97 net at 73 bln rph.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indonesian film distributor and camera company PT Modern Photo said on Friday it expected to post net profit of 73 billion rupiah in 1997 against 63.54 billion rupiah in 1996.</p>
<p>Company director Ahmad Fauzi Hasan told reporters that the forecast was based on net profits recorded in the first quarter of the year.</p>
<p>He said Modern Photo recorded net profit of 16.8 billion rupiah in the first quarter of 1997 against 14.6 billion rupiah in the year-ago period.</p>
</text>
